  "description_short": "Relaxed restobar in central Knysna serving hearty meals, craft drinks, and good vibes on Fitchat Street.",
  "description_long": "Uptown Restobar brings a casual, friendly vibe to Knysna's town centre on Fitchat Street. It's the kind of place where you can settle in for a lazy lunch, catch up with mates over craft beers, or enjoy a laid-back dinner without any fuss. The menu covers the bases with crowd-pleasers like burgers, grills, and pub-style favourites, all served with a smile.\n\nThe atmosphere is easygoing and unpretentious—think wooden tables, a full bar, and a soundtrack that keeps things upbeat. Whether you're popping in for a quick bite or lingering over drinks, Uptown strikes that comfortable balance between restobar energy and neighbourhood hangout. It's a solid choice when you want good food and a relaxed time in the heart of Knysna.",
